flowchart TB
    accTitle: Routed command and event path
    accDescr: The router parses commands and sends them through a queue to one instrument shard. The shard checks sequence and event capacity before applying the command. This path has no journal.

    Frame["Borrowed RX frame"] --> Parse["Parse and normalize once<br/>New, cancel or replace Command"]
    Parse --> Route["Fixed instrument routes<br/>Dense offset or sparse binary search"]
    Route --> Commands["Bounded command SPSC<br/>One queue per shard"]
    Commands -. "Full" .-> Retry["Caller retries unchanged input<br/>When capacity returns"]

    subgraph Shard["MatchingShard: one instrument, one writer"]
        Pending["Dequeue command<br/>Retry pending command first"]
        Admit["Check instrument and next sequence<br/>Reserve one event slot"]
        Apply["Gateway<br/>Risk, book and fixed reports"]
        Batch["Build one EventBatch<br/>Result, trades, changed top of book"]
        Pending --> Admit --> Apply --> Batch
        Admit -. "Event queue full" .-> Retained["Keep command pending<br/>No gateway mutation"]
    end

    Commands --> Pending
    Batch --> Events["Bounded event SPSC<br/>One slot holds the whole batch"]
    Events --> Consumer["Router try_event(shard)<br/>Caller consumes that shard's events"]

    classDef input fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#0f172a
    classDef hot fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef queue fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#3b0764
    classDef refusal fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#c2410c,color:#7c2d12
    class Frame,Parse,Route,Consumer input
    class Pending,Admit,Apply,Batch hot
    class Commands,Events queue
    class Retry,Retained refusal
